  "mn40:0.2": "<p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn2'>DN 2</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn29'>MN 29–30</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn39'>MN 39</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn61'>MN 61</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.82'>AN 3:83</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.122'>AN 3:123</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dhp256-272#dhp258'>Dhp 258–261</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dhp256-272#dhp264'>Dhp 264–269</a></p>",
